BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:R.L. STINE’S GOOSEBUMPS THE MUSICAL: PHANTOM OF THE AUDITORIUM
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T160000
UID:260917y3pdUqdqDUq35S2KU5V8PA
DESCRIPTION:***Spooky fun for the whole family!***\n\n**Get ready for a fr
 ightfully fun adventure with *Goosebumps The Musical\,* based on the wil
 dly popular books by R. L. Stine! When Brooke and Zeke are cast in their s
 chool’s spooky new play\, *The Phantom*\, they start to wonder if the s
 how is actually cursed. As strange messages appear and rehearsals are disr
 upted by a mysterious masked figure\, they must uncover the truth: is it a
 ll an elaborate prank… or is their theater truly haunted? Full of catchy
  songs\, laugh-out-loud moments\, and just the right amount of Halloween-s
 eason chills\, this musical mystery is perfect for kids\, tweens\, and gro
 wn-ups who remember reading by flashlight. *Fun for all ages!*** \n\n**
 “Musically exciting and theatrically adventurous entertainment that is s
 ure to give you goosebumps!” – *BroadwayWorld*** \n\n**Cast Meet and
  Greet: Stick around after the show to meet the cast and get autographs fr
 om your favorite characters!**\n\nSee Constellation’s website for more i
 nformation\, including a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and fin
 d tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/kids/goosebumps/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/kids/goosebumps/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
