BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dine Out for the Library at BJ's
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T230000
UID:261109hqs5QFowK0WaHAbCFQ0pSg
DESCRIPTION:Dine Out for the Library at BJ's Restaurant & Brewhouse (411 S
 . College Mall Road\, Bloomington) on Mondays\, November 9\, 16\, 23\, and
  30 from 11 AM–11 PM for dine in or carry out (including curbside pickup
 ).\n\nChoose from 18 signature handcrafted pizzas\, including tavern-cut\,
  deep dish\, or gluten-free styles. BJ’s offers a variety of soups\, sal
 ads\, handcrafted burgers\, sandwiches\, tacos\, and “enlightened” ent
 rees. Finish off your meal with their famous Pizookie!\n\nShow your flyer\
 , available at any Monroe County Public Library location or online at mcpl
 .info/dineout\, and BJ's will donate 20% of your food and soft beverage ta
 b to the Friends of the Library to help make amazing Library programs poss
 ible. When ordering online\, enter the six-digit fundraiser code for your 
 dining day when you check out. Not valid toward alcoholic beverages\, Happ
 y Hour specials\, or for delivery orders.
LOCATION:BJ's Restaurant
URL:http://mcpl.info/dineout
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
