 gs with an Afro-Caribbean twist.\n\nIt will be a fun-filled\, high energy 
 evening as we celebrate the music of these 20th century icons.\n\nThe Indi
 ana University Latin Jazz Ensemble is a 25-piece ensemble led by trombonis
 t Wayne Wallace and rhythm section coach Andy Miller. Bring your dancing s
 hoes!\n\nThis event is FREE. No tickets are needed.
