 is Red' by Catherynne M. Valente. Age 18 and up Downtown Library Meeting R
 oom 2C Please register here: calendar.mcpl.info/event/17381489 Book summar
 y: In a future where Earth is mostly drowned and only a few patches of lan
 d remain\, Tetley Abednego lives in the magical floating community of Garb
