BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garlands & Greenery Open House at Wylie House Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T160000
UID:261112EA6oi9KbwEyNHWUAHKAzFA
DESCRIPTION:Join Wylie House Museum for its festive Garlands & Greenery Op
 en House on Saturday\, December 5\, from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. This free\, dro
 p-in event invites you to experience the museum adorned for the holiday se
 ason.\n\nWander through the historic house at your own pace\, surrounded b
 y fresh greenery and traditional holiday decorations. Costumed staff will 
 be on hand to welcome you\, share stories\, and answer questions.\n\nEnjoy
  live music throughout the day\, featuring the Dickens Carolers\, IU stude
 nt musicians and á cappella groups\, and the Horseshoe Bend String Band. 
 In the Museum’s Education Center\, warm up with hot cider and cocoa\, en
 joy holiday cookies\, and try your hand at family-friendly craft activitie
 s.\n\nCome celebrate the season with music\, merriment\, and the timeless 
 beauty of Wylie House Museum! No registration required.\n\nParking: Design
 ated\, free Wylie House parking spots are located behind the museum and ed
 ucation center\, accessible via the alley. Free street parking is located 
 directly in front of the museum on 2nd St. and is permissible on Saturdays
  in all the area neighborhood residential zoned spaces.\n\nAccessibility: 
 The museum has accessible parking next to the museum’s Morton C. Bradley
 \, Jr. Education Center\, with a path that leads to a ramp at the back doo
 r entrance of the museum. While the historic home’s second floor is only
  accessible by staircase\, digital images and virtual tour options are pro
 vided for visitors who cannot visit the second floor. Please contact us in
  advance of your visit to discuss any specific needs.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\
 \*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\n\nLooking for a fully guided tour of the historic home? Visit Wylie 
 House Museum on Friday\, December 4\; Friday\, December 11\; or Saturday\,
  December 12. Free holiday season tours are offered at the top of each hou
 r from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.\, with the final tour beginning at 3 p.m.
LOCATION:Wylie House Museum
URL:https://limestonepost.org/calendar/#/details/garlands-greenery-open-ho
 use-at-wylie-house-museum/20418766/2026-12-05T10
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
