BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Curiosity Lab at WonderLab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261222T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261222T160000
UID:261022rRIh7cU7FUeUo0e-Uoe1bA
DESCRIPTION:Curiosity Lab is an after-school\, free play program for kids 
 ages 6-10 years. Children are invited to explore\, experiment\, and engage
  in hands-on sensory activities at their own pace. No instructions\, no pr
 essure-just curiosity-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdo
 ors weather permitting\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a var
 iety of rotating materials and stations. There will be one main activity/i
 nstallment/manipulative for the month that will be brought out every Thurs
 day. This will rotate with the month and the month's theme.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/curiosity-lab-at-wonderlab
 -00a2
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
