BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:THE CONSTELLATE SHOW: HOLIDAY SPECIAL
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261226T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261226T193000
UID:260922k2t4dBEqPkGZ-9Ewqk6EdQ
DESCRIPTION:***Live music\, laughs\, and a little holiday magic!***\n\n**T
 he ConstelLate Show is Constellation’s very own late-night holiday speci
 al—part talk show\, part variety show\, and completely one-of-a-kind. Ru
 nning throughout the holidays with brand-new guests each night\, this fest
 ive evening brings together local luminaries\, performers\, and personalit
 ies. Each episode features interviews\, games\, live music\, comedy\, surp
 rise talents\, and a few unexpected twists. Complete with cameras and live
  monitors\, audiences won’t just watch the show—they’ll feel like th
 ey’re part of the broadcast. It’s joyful\, it’s unpredictable\, and 
 it’s the most Constellation way imaginable to celebrate the season.**\n\
 nSee Constellation’s website for more information\, including a detailed
  performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstella
 tion.org/event/constellate-show/
LOCATION:Waldron Firebay
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/event/constellate-show/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ANNIE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261226T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261226T140000
UID:260918ACazP0jdpUuuMldseeTBEQ
DESCRIPTION:***The Sun Will Come Out Tomorrow***\n\n**Discover the magic o
 f *Annie*\, the iconic Broadway musical that has captured hearts for gene
 rations! The timeless tale of Little Orphan Annie follows a tenacious youn
 g girl whose unbreakable optimism leads her on an unforgettable journey fr
 om a New York City orphanage to a place she can finally call home. Featuri
 ng one of Broadway’s most memorable scores\, including “It’s the Har
 d-Knock Life\,” “Easy Street\,” “N.Y.C.” and the endlessly-uplif
 ting “Tomorrow\,” *Annie* is a delightful theatrical experience for 
 the entire family. *Fun for all ages!***\n\n**“One of the best family m
 usicals ever penned.” – *Chicago Tribune***\n\nSee Constellation’s 
 website for more information\, including a detailed performance schedule. 
 Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
