BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AN ENEMY OF THE PEOPLE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270211T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270211T193000
UID:260922-SGn8dv7HUmjq53Fo9AqsA
DESCRIPTION:***Henrik Ibsen’s gripping story of truth\, power\, and the 
 price of speaking out.***\n\n**This Tony-nominated adaptation of Henrik Ib
 sen’s masterpiece follows a small-town doctor who discovers a catastroph
 e that risks the lives of everyone in town. After raising the alarm\, he i
 s shaken to his core as those in power\, including his own brother\, not o
 nly try to silence him—they try to destroy him.**\n\n**“This classic d
 rama is a play for our time” – *The Hollywood Reporter***\n\n**Pay Wh
 at You Will Thursday Performance**\n\nSee Constellation’s website for mo
 re information\, including a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and
  find tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/enemy-of-the-peopl
 e/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/enemy-of-the-people/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
